  "title": "Easy Chocolate Custard",
  "description": "Say goodbye to water baths and baking; this stovetop chocolate custard with brandy and Dutch-processed cocoa powder takes 10 minutes to cook. Just chill before serving.",
  "authors": [
    "moe's cookin'"
  ],
  "date_published": "2020-06-19T00:33:13-04:00",
